<title>CHINA: China Jan-March zinc output up 37.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-March zinc output up 37.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's total zinc output in the first quarter was 326,800 tonnes, up 37.4 percent compared with the year-ago period, the Shanghai Securities News said on Friday quoting figures from the State Statistical Bureau.</p>
<p>Production in March alone was 121,500 tonnes, up 16.7 percent from the adjusted figure for February, it said.</p>
